  <li><a href="photo/Above_Ground_Pipe_and_Dalton.html" alt="Zigzag Configuration Photo" longdesc="To allow for thermal expansion and contraction of the aboveground pipe, the pipeline was constructed in a flexible zigzag configuration. This design allows lengthwise expansion of the pipe to be translated into sideways movement. This photo shows the pipeline on the left and the Dalton Highway on the right.">Zigzag Configuration Photo</a></li>
